                                    <p style="margin-bottom: 15px;">Dependent Visa Services</p>
                                    <h2 class="title">Sponsor Your Family in the UAE: Hassle-Free &amp; Fully Compliant</h2>
                                    <p>Bringing your loved ones to live with you in Dubai is a deeply rewarding milestone, but navigating the strict legal frameworks of family sponsorship requires total administrative precision. To secure active residency files for your dependents, every document, from marriage certificates to medical reports, must satisfy explicit ministry criteria to prevent unexpected processing halts or background rejections.</p>
                                    <p>At Virtuo, we treat your family's relocation with maximum care and efficiency. Our dedicated public relations officers manage your entire dependency pipeline directly with immigration authorities and medical boards, handling everything from initial entry permits to final identity cards so your loved ones transition into their new life with complete peace of mind.</p>
                                </div>
                                <div class="services__details-thumb">
                                    <img src="assets/img/services/DependentVisaImg1.jpg" alt="Dependent Visa" style="margin-top:20px; margin-bottom: 10px;">
                                </div>
                                <div class="services__details-content">
                                    <h2 class="title-two">Who Can Sponsor Dependents in the UAE?</h2>
                                    <p class="info-two">Our specialized documentation workflows ensure your family files pass through immigration checkpoints smoothly. We manage end-to-end visa administration across all core sponsorship paths:</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>1. Spouse Sponsorship Management</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Legal processing to bring your husband or wife to the UAE, ensuring your marital records satisfy strict domestic legalization standards.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>2. Sponsorship for Sons &amp; Daughters</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Administering residency files for unmarried daughters without age limits and securing approvals for qualifying sons under local regulations.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>3. Newborn In-Country Registrations</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Seamlessly establishing fresh residency profiles, security files, and identity cards for infants born directly inside the UAE.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>4. Long-Term Golden Visa Dependency</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Utilizing premium ten-year self-sponsored privileges to bring your family over under relaxed independent conditions with zero age caps.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>5. Parent &amp; In-Law Residency Frameworks</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Handling the specialized, multi-layered document packets, housing verifications, and financial files required to sponsor parents.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>6. Medical Fitness &amp; Biometric Booking</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Scheduling and coordinating mandatory blood tests, chest x-rays, and physical fingerprint captures at official government hubs.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>7. Dependent Emirates ID Collections</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Tracking the processing queues and managing the final delivery of physical identity cards to secure your family's local access.</p>
