                                                <div class="faq__wrap faq__wrap-three">
                                                    <div class="accordion" id="immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-accordion">
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseOne">1. What is the minimum salary required to sponsor a spouse and children in Dubai?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>To act as a family sponsor, a male resident must demonstrate a baseline monthly salary threshold, which can be slightly adjusted if the employer officially provides housing within the employment contract package. Virtuo's compliance team reviews your labor papers and tenancy contracts beforehand, verifying that your documented income satisfies federal guidelines to ensure a flawless application.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseTwo">2. Can a female resident sponsor her husband and children for residency?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>Yes, absolutely. Under modern UAE immigration guidelines, an employed female resident has the full legal right to sponsor her husband and children, provided her monthly salary meets the distinct income thresholds specified for female sponsors. When managing your file, Virtuo acts as your specialized PRO liaison, compiling the required work certificates and navigating special regulatory pathways to secure fast family approvals.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseThree">3. What are the key housing requirements for sponsoring family members?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>Immigration authorities require definite proof that the sponsor maintains suitable, legally registered accommodation capable of supporting the family size. For residents in Dubai, this means you must provide an active Ejari contract registered with the Dubai Land Department. Virtuo cross-checks your tenancy details prior to filing, ensuring your property files match municipal criteria to prevent automatic application rejections.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseFour">4. Are there any age limitations when sponsoring children under a family visa?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-dependent-visa-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>Yes, age rules apply differently depending on the gender of your children; unmarried daughters can be sponsored indefinitely without age barriers, whereas sons face explicit age limitations unless they qualify under student status or special needs categories. Virtuo strategically structures your dependent files, auditing your children's milestone dates to map out long-term residency options, including transitions into independent paths or long-term Golden Visas.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
