                                    <p class="info-two">Facilitating residential and commercial property residency pathways through direct coordination with local land departments.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>3. Corporate Partner Residency Frameworks</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Managing multi-shareholder entity allocations, ensuring company charters precisely reflect investor equity stakes.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>4. Unified Immigration File Management</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Opening your primary corporate e-channel profiles across federal identity portals to authorize visa issuance.</p>
