                                                <div class="faq__wrap faq__wrap-three">
                                                    <div class="accordion" id="immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-accordion">
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseOne">1. What are the primary routes to obtaining an investor visa in Dubai?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>Residency by investment is primarily achieved through two distinct legal pathways: either by establishing or holding documented share capital within a registered mainland or free zone company, or by acquiring residential real estate in your personal name within a freehold area. Virtuo's corporate team evaluates your capital setup to position your application under the optimal framework, ensuring your assets clear ministry guidelines smoothly.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseTwo">2. What are the recent updates regarding minimum property investment thresholds?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>Recent regulatory rollouts from local land departments have significantly lowered entry barriers by completely removing the historical minimum property-value threshold for individual sole property owners seeking the standard renewable two-year residency visa. Virtuo acts as your direct asset registry proxy, cross-checking your title deeds and coordinating with real estate authorities so you can secure independent residency based on your property ownership, regardless of its market value.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseThree">3. What are the mandatory compliance requirements for renewing a business company investor visa?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>To maintain valid investor residency status at renewal, business owners must demonstrate active corporate substance, including verified shareholding capital written into the license, active corporate banking transactions, and a legally registered commercial office lease (Ejari). Virtuo secures your long-term operational standing by actively managing these documentation loops, preparing your company files well in advance of expiration dates to prevent system blocks.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseFour">4. How does a standard two-year investor visa differ from the ten-year UAE Golden Visa?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-investor-visa-dubai-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>While both pathways grant self-sponsored residency and family sponsorship privileges without requiring an outside employer, the fundamental differences lie in the overall visa duration, the specific asset value thresholds required, and travel flexibility rules. Virtuo strategically structures your legal portfolios, helping you determine whether the standard renewable option or the long-term, zero-absence-restriction Golden Visa framework best fits your lifestyle and expansion goals.</p>
