                                                    <div class="accordion" id="immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-accordion">
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseOne">1. What is the fundamental difference between GDRFA and ICP smart services?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>The primary difference lies in the specific local geographic jurisdiction responsible for generating your entry clearance or residence file. Virtuo maps out your route correctly because the GDRFA platform handles visas and company profiles issued strictly within the Emirate of Dubai, whereas the federal ICP network regulates residency data for the remaining six Emirates.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseTwo">2. How long do standard GDRFA visa approvals typically take to process?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>When navigating government portals independently, document omissions or data entry mismatches can stall your files and cause system rejections. Virtuo protects your onboarding timeline by pre-auditing your passport details and corporate papers, utilizing expedited digital pathways to secure your official entry permits and residency validations within minimal turnaround windows.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseThree">3. What types of legal alerts or application statuses can Virtuo track through the GDRFA?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>Our systems maintain real-time tracking loops that monitor active applications, entry permit expirations, current residency validity details, and potential border fine notifications. Virtuo acts as your proactive compliance watch, identifying potential administrative alerts early so we can process updates before your files incur automated late penalties or travel blocks.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseFour">4. Why does an active company need a GDRFA establishment card?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-gdrfa-services-dubai-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>A company establishment card is the foundational file that registers your corporate trade license inside the immigration department's central database. Virtuo establishes this account from day one, unlocking your entity's ability to issue employment visas, sponsor international staff, and scale your overall team headcount without encountering regulatory barriers.</p>
