                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-collapseOne">1. What is the fundamental difference between a Free Zone freelance permit and a Green Visa?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>The primary variations lie in your overall residency duration, sponsorship independence, and historical financial benchmarks. Virtuo maps out your route correctly because a standard free zone permit grants a renewable multi-year residency tied directly to that specific economic zone's infrastructure, whereas the five-year Green Visa operates as a prestigious, fully federal, self-sponsored track for established independent workers who satisfy distinct qualification criteria.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-collapseTwo">2. Can I legally work with mainland UAE companies using a Free Zone freelance visa?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>Yes, under modern commercial frameworks, independent professionals holding valid freelance permits can legally offer services, sign corporate contracts, and execute B2B transactions with mainland entities. Virtuo's corporate team carefully structures your baseline activity codes during the licensing phase, ensuring your regulatory scope accommodates your targeted local and international client networks seamlessly.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-collapseThree">3. What are the mandatory document requirements needed to apply for a freelance visa?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-freelance-visa-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>To initiate an error-free processing cycle, you must provide clear passport copies, background photographs, an updated resume detailing your work history, and verifiable proof of your professional capabilities, such as an attested degree or a curated portfolio. Virtuo acts as your documentation manager, cross-auditing your files prior to upload to ensure they satisfy strict ministerial checklist criteria to prevent automatic rejections.</p>
