                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>Opening corporate banking facilities as an independent worker requires demonstrating sound commercial legitimacy, including your active freelance permit, an active establishment card, and verified client agreements or invoices. Virtuo safeguards your financial transition by organizing your compliance documentation and matching your professional activity with premium local banking networks to streamline the onboarding review.</p>
