                                            <div class="col-lg-6">
                                                <div class="section__title text-center mb-50">
                                                    <span class="sub-title">FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</span>
                                                    <h2 class="title">Got any questions?</h2>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="row justify-content-center">
                                            <div class="col-xl-8 col-lg-10" style="width: 100%;">
                                                <div class="faq__wrap faq__wrap-three">
                                                    <div class="accordion" id="immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-accordion">
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseOne">1. What exactly is a UAE residence visa, and why does my family need it?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>A residence visa is an official government permit that grants foreign nationals the legal right to reside in the country for an extended duration. Virtuo's immigration team manages this mandatory transition because maintaining an active residency file is the exact legal prerequisite required to lease residential homes, open local personal bank accounts, and enroll your children in regional school systems.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseTwo" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseTwo">2. What are the latest updates regarding property investor residence visas?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseTwo" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>Recent regulatory updates from the Dubai Land Department have significantly expanded access by entirely removing previous minimum purchase-value thresholds for individual sole property owners seeking the standard two-year residency visa. Virtuo acts as your direct asset registry proxy, cross-checking your title deeds and coordinating with real estate authorities so you can secure independent residency based on your property ownership.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseThree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseThree">3. Can I sponsor my immediate family members under my Dubai residence visa?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseThree" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>Yes, absolutely. Once your primary residency file is fully stamped and active, you have the legal right to sponsor your spouse, children, and parents, provided you satisfy the baseline monthly income criteria set by immigration ministries. Virtuo handles this entire dependent integration loop, organizing your birth certificates, marriage files, and health tests to clear your family's applications smoothly.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                        <div class="accordion-item">
                                                            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                                                                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseFour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseFour">4. How long can a standard residency holder stay outside the country before the visa lapses?</button>
                                                            </h2>
                                                            <div id="immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-collapseFour" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#immigration-residency-solutions-residence-visa-accordion">
                                                                <div class="accordion-body">
                                                                    <p>Standard employment and family visa holders must not remain outside the country for more than a set continuous duration without risking automatic system invalidation, though specialized paths like the Golden Visa offer exemptions to this rule. Virtuo protects your legal travel flexibility by auditing your milestone dates and managing formal re-entry permit applications through federal portals if unexpected travel disruptions arise.</p>
                                                                </div>
                                                            </div>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
