                                    <h2 class="title-two">What Our Employment Visa Services Include</h2>
                                    <p class="info-two">Our dedicated public relations and document clearing workflows ensure your company's workforce applications pass through government networks seamlessly. We handle end-to-end administration across the following core areas:</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>1. MOHRE Work Permit Applications</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Initiating the critical baseline employee approvals and electronic quota slots required to sponsor staff.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>2. Electronic Job Offer &amp; Contract Registration</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Drafting and filing official employment contracts across digital ministries to lock in legal terms.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>3. In-Country Visa Status Modifications</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Executing seamless legal transitions for incoming staff members who are already located inside the country.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>4. Corporate Establishment Card Management</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Setting up and renewing your primary company profiles across immigration portals to maintain visa issuance power.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>5. Mandatory Medical &amp; Biometric Coordination</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Organizing expedited health screenings and required fingerprinting steps at official state testing hubs.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>6. Wage Protection System (WPS) Alignment</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Structuring company payroll pipelines to perfectly match federal salary distribution regulations.</p>
                                    <p class="info-one"><b>7. Employment Residency Cancellations &amp; Transitions</b></p>
                                    <p class="info-two">Managing formal work permit revocations and structural handovers cleanly when staff roles change.</p>
